<title>ANGOLA: PRESS DIGEST - Angola - Jan 21.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Angola - Jan 21.</headline>
<dateline>LUANDA 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Angola press on Tuesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>JORNAL DE ANGOLA</p>
<p>- South African vice president Thabo Mbeki leaves Luanda today after a two-day in which he and a delegation of government officials discussed the Angolan peace process.</p>
<p>- Fifty homes will be made available to UNITA deputies in the Golf Two suburb of Luanda.</p>
</text>
